# kb-mastra-infra — handoff

Updated: 2026-09-05 (sixth pass: the shipped shape moved to util 0.64 / 8 seats to fund a second consumer's GPU reservation; `master` merged at `2a5887a`).

## What this is

One GPU host serving three models behind a single LAN endpoint, merged from two salvaged and
non-functional compose files (`eda-mastra-platform/docker-compose.rag.yml` truncated copy, and
`inference-realworld/docker-compose.vllm-nvfp4.yaml` investigation variant). `README.md` is the
reference; this file is only the resume point.

```
LAN ──▶ 0.0.0.0:4000 (kb-litellm) ──┬─▶ vllm-chat        chat-model  (+ -off -low -medium -xhigh)
                                    ├─▶ vllm-embedding   embedding-model   2560-dim
                                    └─▶ vllm-reranker    reranker-model
```

The three engines publish **no host port**. The gateway is the only way in.

