the authority; §2c has the fan-out evidence.**

Retrieval is **unchanged** — the 4B pair, 2560-dim, still up. `chat-model` still answers at 131,072,
so every consumer contract holds. `smoke.sh` 30/30 on this shape.

**Do not size a co-resident service against a free-card reading.** This block used to say "card free
7,356 MiB, which is the docling reservation the operator named". That figure was read at boot and is
not a floor: re-read on the *same* boot after only `smoke.sh` and a few contract probes, the card gave
